Does QIAGEN offer a QIAzol-based RNA isolation kit? 
  Yes.
What kits are QIAzol-based?
  miRNeasy Kits    combine phenol/guanidine-based sample lysis using QIAzol Lysis Reagent with silica-membrane spin-column purification to isolate total RNA (including miRNA)
  RNeasy Universal Kits  (e.g. RNeasy Universal Mini Kit and RNeasy Plus Universal Mini Kit)
  QIAzol Lysis Reagent - monophasic solution of phenol and guanidine thiocyanate that can also be paried with RNeasy cleanup kits of phase-separation tools

